{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">BURST is a small one to four player local sports game that takes a very different spin on bubble football. Try your luck against an overwhelming number of opponents and lay waste to the field in the process.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Inspired by hallmarks of the genre like NES World Cup  this game is also easy to pick up ideally enjoyed with friends.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">1 - 4 player local co-op with gamepads</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Remote Play Together supported</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">adaptive difficulty</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">2D retro pixel graphics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">tackle your your opponents to gain control over the field</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">charge up and use a power shot to score a goal</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">short 5 minute rounds, ideal for in-between times</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3509250?t=1739879244","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3509250/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1739879244","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3509250/1aa0f5ed050e839db6361df0df6f862bd2c6133d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1739879244","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3509250/1aa0f5ed050e839db6361df0df6f862bd2c6133d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1739879244","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen Co-op","id":39},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Remote Play Together","id":44},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"c